Subject: [PATCH 65/71] docs: add README as the entry point of the final source
 tree

Indexes what is in the repository (our additions vs the vendor baseline), how
to build both variants with build_eebbk_clang11.sh, what the two configs differ
in, the flashable images with their md5s, the per-subsystem change table with
pointers into EEBBK_S6_changes.md, and an honest list of what is still open
(the speaker-protection/iv_feedback all-silence bug, the Android 15/16 GSI BPF
question, the untaken /vendor slimming).

Build outputs (out_*) and the /vendor experiment leftovers are not part of the
tree -- they are regenerable and were removed before packing.

Signed-off-by: Zhiyu722 <Zhiyu722@users.noreply.github.com>
